# Gitignore for C Programming Assignments

# 1. Block Windows Executables
*.exe
*.lnk

# 2. Block compiled object files and libraries
*.o
*.obj
*.out

# 3. Block Mac/Linux Compiled Executables (Extensionless)
# This rule matches executable outputs commonly made in terminal compilation 
myprogram
a.out

# 4. Block VS Code Environment and Workspace configuration caches
.vscode/
*.log
